---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BrowseBlocks from '../components/BrowseBlocks.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
const locale = 'en';
const updated = 'August 31, 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use — Skala Convert"
  description="Terms for using the Skala Convert unit converters: accuracy limits, where not to rely on the results, acceptable use, advertising and intellectual property."
  locale={locale}
  alternates={[
    { hreflang: 'en', href: 'https://skalaconvert.com/terms-of-use/' },
    { hreflang: 'es', href: 'https://skalaconvert.com/es/terminos-de-uso/' }
  ]}
>
  <main class="wrap">
    <Breadcrumbs locale={locale} items={[{ label: "Terms of Use" }]} />
    <div class="hero"><h1>Terms of Use</h1></div>

    <section class="block legal">
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>By using Skala Convert you agree to the terms below. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

      <h2>What this site is</h2>
      <p>
        Skala Convert provides free unit conversion tools for general reference. It is
        offered as-is, with no guarantee that it will be available, uninterrupted, or
        free of errors.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        The conversion factors used here come from the internationally defined values —
        one inch is exactly 0.0254 metres, one pound is exactly 0.45359237 kilograms, and
        so on. Results are rounded for display, so a figure shown here may differ in the
        final decimal places from one calculated at higher precision.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Do not rely on this site where an error would matter.</strong> For
        medical dosing, engineering tolerances, legal or financial figures, structural
        calculations, aviation, or navigation, verify the result against an authoritative
        source appropriate to that field. We accept no liability for any loss, injury, or
        damage arising from use of these results.
      </p>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        The site may be changed, interrupted, or discontinued at any time without notice.
        Converters, units, and pages may be added or removed.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You may use the converters freely, including for commercial work. You may not
        attempt to disrupt the site, scrape it at a volume that degrades service for
        others, or reproduce the site wholesale to create a duplicate for the purpose of
        diverting traffic.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Conversion factors are facts and belong to no one. The name Skala Convert, the
        site's design, and its written content are ours. The underlying arithmetic is
        free for anyone to study and reimplement.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links and advertising</h2>
      <p>
        Advertising on this site is served by Google and its partners. We do not select,
        endorse, or vouch for the advertisers shown, and we are not responsible for the
        content of any site an advertisement leads to.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated. The date at the top of this page reflects the most
        recent version, and continued use of the site after a change means you accept it.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms:
        <a href="mailto:contact@skalaconvert.com">contact@skalaconvert.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <BrowseBlocks locale={locale} limit={4} />
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: var(--measure); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; margin: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-2); }
  .legal p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .legal a { color: var(--accent); }
  .updated { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .875rem; }
</style>
